A couple of strange things have happened in my current game of Hack, like 
on level 10 I encountered a spellbook to charm monsters, after trying it 
out, I found out that each time I cast it, it makes everybody in a 1 
square vicinity of me, my pet!!! Well, that was great! About level 15 I 
came upon an opulent throne room, in which there was about 20+ mosnters 
in there, ranging from a few dragons to some HobGoblins, I thought okay, 
its about time I had another pet, so I charmed a few dragons, and hid 
around the corner, and came back, and bingo, the dragons were throwing 
firre every where, with all sorts of messages about hob-goblins attcking 
hobgoblins, and a hobgoblin got hit by a blast of flame, etc..
 I thought WOW! What fun! So now, anything that comes my way, has a 
dragon to face as well, (and I am not exactly in a bad shape, level 11 
experience, and 80 Hp, and 44 Ep, and -6 Ac , and with a few +4 
weapons...and whats more I didnt polymorph a thing!
 Anyway, after wondering around, and trying to figure out what to do with 
the opulent throne, (what do I do!?!), I gave up and went down a level, 
and then did the general exploring and so fourth, when I found some wierd 
message on the floor, it was the treasure room one, I as I have had some 
experience in that (I went in there without Teleport or digging and lost 
well over 10,000 Gp! :-( ), so I searched for the doors as normal, and 
found one, entered, and then the screen changed, and I was in a new room, 
only the walls where all funny, instead of the normal |,- walls, there 
were just '-' walls, ie the place looked like :

  -------
  -..@..-
  -- ----
   - -
   - -
 --- ---
 - 
 -------

 and so on, so I wondered around with my doggy, and draggy [:-)], and 
 found a stair case going up, I then wondered what level I was on, and 
found I was on level 31 or something like that, so I went up, and once up 
I found another going up right underneath me, and it was like this, until 
I reached level 25 (?), and once I was there, I was in the normal looking 
maze with the correct walls etc, and I saw a figure 8 in the room I was 
in, so naturally I went and attacked it, only to find I had, *had* my 
first experience for Medusa...
 Anyway, is this 'charm monster' a common spell? Cause it is *damn* 
handly to have, better than polypiling almost! :-)
